  "title": "Give and Go – pass and sprint into the slot",
  "description": "Two lines at the centre line: A near the boards and B more central. A goalkeeper in goal. A takes a few steps forward as B passes. A carries on with the ball while B sprints towards the slot. A passes in and B shoots first time.\n\nRotation: switch lines after the shot. Run it mirrored so both sides get trained. The diagram is not to scale.",
  "coachingPoints": [
    {
      "id": "cp1",
      "text": "The receiver shows with the stick where the pass should go."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp2",
      "text": "B passes and sprints at once – don't wait to watch the ball."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp3",
      "text": "A plays the pass in front of B in the slot."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp4",
      "text": "Shoot first time and hit the target."
    }
  ],
